  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening capacities in Mexico to combat all forms of discrimination</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This RP Workplan seeks to strengthen the capacities of both national, subnational and local authorities regarding the combat of discrimination and racism towards the most vulnerable population groups. In relation to the 2019 approved Resolution on &quot;Elimination in the World of Racial Discrimination, Racial Supremacism and Racial Hate Crimes&quot;, and the 2022 Global Forum against Racism edition in Mexico, this will contribute to the Global Call against Racism and the development of inclusive policies through the exchange and discussion of innovative experiences and challenges. In this framework, the project will also implement the anti-racism tools already developed and to seek further dissemination with new actors.</narrative>
  </description>
